#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/autonumbering_panel.rst:7
msgid "Auto Numbering Selection panel"
msgstr "自动编号选择面板"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/autonumbering_panel.rst:9
msgid ""
"The Auto Numbering Selection panel displays the active `auto numbering "
"pattern`_ for:"
msgstr "自动编号选择面板显示活动 `自动编号模式 <auto numbering pattern_>`_ 用于："

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/autonumbering_panel.rst:11
msgid "`Folio`_"
msgstr "`图幅 <Folio_>`_"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/autonumbering_panel.rst:12
msgid "`Element`_"
msgstr "`元件 <Element_>`_"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/autonumbering_panel.rst:13
msgid "`Conductor`_"
msgstr "`导体 <Conductor_>`_"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/autonumbering_panel.rst:18
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Auto Numbering Selection panel"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 自动编号选择面板"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/autonumbering_panel.rst:20
msgid "To display or hidden the Auto Numbering Selection panel:"
msgstr "要显示或隐藏自动编号选择面板："

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/autonumbering_panel.rst:22
msgid "Select **Settings > Display > Auto Numbering Selection** menu item."
msgstr "选择 **设置 > 显示 > 自动编号选择** 菜单项。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/autonumbering_panel.rst:24
msgid ""
"The main function from the Auto Numbering Selection panel is to manage `auto"
" numbering patterns`_."
msgstr "自动编号选择面板的主要功能是管理 `自动编号模式 <auto numbering patterns_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/autonumbering_panel.rst:26
msgid "Select the active folio auto numbering pattern"
msgstr "选择活动化的自动编号模式"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/autonumbering_panel.rst:27
msgid "Select the active element auto numbering pattern"
msgstr "选择活动元素自动编号模式"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/autonumbering_panel.rst:32
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech element pattern selection"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech元素模式选择"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/autonumbering_panel.rst:34
msgid "Select the active conductor auto numbering pattern"
msgstr "选择活动导线自动编号模式"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/autonumbering_panel.rst:41
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech conductor pattern selection"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech导电模式选择"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/autonumbering_panel.rst:45
msgid ""
"For more information about how to use the Auto Numbering Select panel during"
" folio addition, refer to `add folio`_ section."
msgstr "关于在folio添加时如何使用自动编号选择面板的更多信息，请参见 `add folio <add folio_>`_ 部分。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/autonumbering_panel.rst:48
msgid ""
"For more information about how to use the Auto Numbering Select panel during"
" element addition, refer to `add element`_ section."
msgstr "关于元素添加时如何使用自动编号选择面板的更多信息，请参见 `添加元素 <add element_>`_ 部分。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/autonumbering_panel.rst:51
msgid ""
"For more information about how to use the Auto Numbering Select panel during"
" conductor creation, refer to `create conductor`_ section."
msgstr "关于导电器创建期间如何使用自动编号选择面板的更多信息，请参见 `创建导电器 <create conductor_>`_ 部分。"
